@Dante Thanks for the update. Any questions on the spec? Here's my reply to what you shared after the dev team kickoff:
1. Quick Pay testing: a. Could you check how the QA handled Quick Pay testing during the initial development of this feature? b. Just to double-check — is Samsung Pay specifically unable to process KRW payments from the VN side? Could you confirm this point again? c. Quick Pay support itself can be covered from the KR side, but we'll need to discuss the dev/stg environment payment setup internally on the KR side first. I'll let you know if any support from dev/QA is needed or if there are any updates.
2. Schedule: OK
